WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Marcus Lee: I want to review a few recent discovery calls where we didn't confirm an economic buyer.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Jake Thompson: Two of mine fall into that category, I moved too quickly into the demo.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:13.000
Marcus Lee: Let's slow that down, qualifying budget and decision process should come before scheduling a demo.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Jake Thompson: Understood, I'll use the discovery guide checklist more deliberately on the next set of calls.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:22.000
Marcus Lee: Let's revisit these specific deals again next week and see if qualification improved.
